{"v":1,"id":"6b0e1b263c24","synced":false,"offset":null,"source":"whisper","lines":[{"t":"I watched you calm the waters","s":24.26,"e":28.64},{"t":"I heard the thunder know your name","s":30.08,"e":34.2},{"t":"Still the storm inside grew louder","s":36.24,"e":40.26},{"t":"But you called me just the same","s":41.9,"e":44.64},{"t":"You said come out where I'm standing","s":47.52,"e":50.72},{"t":"My fear fought every breath","s":53.6,"e":56.46},{"t":"But love was stronger than my doubting","s":60.0,"e":64.18},{"t":"So I took that step","s":64.18,"e":68.18},{"t":"When I took that step","s":68.18,"e":74.04},{"t":"I'm at mercy mid-wave","s":74.04,"e":76.94},{"t":"When the wind tried to drown me","s":77.58,"e":80.56},{"t":"Your hand still gave grace","s":80.56,"e":83.02},{"t":"I sank in my weakness","s":83.02,"e":86.24},{"t":"Rose in your strength","s":86.24,"e":88.7},{"t":"When I took that step","s":88.7,"e":91.66},{"t":"My heart found faith","s":91.66,"e":94.6},{"t":"Every failure whispered louder","s":94.6,"e":99.16},{"t":"Saying that was not enough","s":101.5,"e":104.96},{"t":"Till your voice cut through the chaos","s":107.2,"e":111.14},{"t":"With a greater kind of love","s":112.8,"e":115.62},{"t":"You pulled me from my sinking","s":118.72,"e":121.76},{"t":"Said, my child, don't you forget","s":124.32,"e":127.18},{"t":"Faith's not found in the boat you're in","s":130.5,"e":134.56},{"t":"It lives in your next step","s":136.56,"e":139.7},{"t":"When I took that step","s":142.58,"e":144.86},{"t":"I met mercy midway","s":144.86,"e":147.6},{"t":"When the wind tried to drown me, your hand still gave grace","s":147.6,"e":153.84},{"t":"I sank in my weakness, rose in your strength","s":154.38,"e":159.66},{"t":"When I took that step, my heart found faith","s":160.22,"e":165.48},{"t":"My heart found faith","s":170.9,"e":174.3},{"t":"Oh, I'll walk where you lead me","s":178.48,"e":182.2},{"t":"Even out on the tide","s":182.2,"e":184.78},{"t":"If it's you that I'm seeing","s":184.78,"e":187.78},{"t":"I don't need to hide","s":187.78,"e":190.52},{"t":"Every wave is an altar","s":190.52,"e":193.82},{"t":"Where your promise is kept","s":193.82,"e":196.56},{"t":"And every breath is a prayer","s":196.56,"e":199.48},{"t":"Like the one I wept","s":201.2,"e":204.02},{"t":"When I took that step","s":207.24,"e":209.52},{"t":"You met me halfway","s":210.06,"e":212.16},{"t":"You silenced my storm","s":212.16,"e":215.42},{"t":"And called faith by name","s":215.42,"e":218.3},{"t":"I'll never forget","s":218.3,"e":221.18},{"t":"How your hand still saves","s":221.18,"e":224.28},{"t":"When I took that step","s":224.92,"e":227.1},{"t":"My heart found faith","s":227.1,"e":230.02},{"t":"When I took that step","s":236.5,"e":238.84},{"t":"When I took that step","s":247.44,"e":250.42},{"t":"My heart found faith.","s":257.1,"e":259.3}],"match":null}
